CORE
main.cpp

^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* sizeof: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* element: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* next header: SUCCESS$
^\*\* 1 of \d+ failed
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
A flexible array member contributes no size, as in the C front end:
`sizeof(header)' was rejected ("type has no size"), which in a system header
dropped the body of glibc's __cmsg_nxthdr.
